# UI

- Server Components by default. Client only for the console (`Workspace`) and other interactive state.
- Reuse tokens from `src/app/globals.css`: ink, parchment, copper, sage. No purple AI gradients.
- Headlines use `font-serif`. Body uses the system sans stack in `globals.css`.
- Do not add a component library. Keep the landing and console visually related.
- The console must show crew status, the brief, and the run trace together.
